## Coding Guidelines

- Use Arduino framework (not ESP-IDF directly)
- Prefer async patterns with FreeRTOS tasks
- Log to SD card using SDLogger for debugging
- Keep BLE responses under 512 bytes
- Always shut down BLE before OTA download (memory constraint)

## Common Issues

### SD Card Timeout During OTA
Call `SDLogger::flush()` before starting OTA download to ensure SD card mutex is released.

### WiFi Won't Connect
Check NVS storage - credentials may be corrupted. Use `wifi_config` BLE command to re-save.

### BLE Not Advertising
Ensure device name is set before starting BLE:
```cpp
BLEDevice::init("{{ PROJECT_NAME_PASCAL }}");
```
